{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c8cd","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a9b7-1be4-70c3-9f65-33dc9d5961ad"},"sequence":705,"recorded_at":1780531400001405,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f764a614-f959-4acf-aa23-1fc534b9bf47","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"f764a614-f959-4acf-aa23-1fc534b9bf47","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f764a614-f959-4acf-aa23-1fc534b9bf47"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a9ba-6d97-76f2-bb24-d6601a3ea957"},"task_id":"01a0a9ba-6d97-76f2-bb24-d6601a3ea957","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a9ba-6d97-76f2-bb24-d6601a3ea957","chunk":"{\"query\":\"NWError wifiAware macOS 26 availability Swift\",\"results\":[{\"url\":\"https://github.com/bashgeek/textwerk/commit/989e23efcd4e641bed57b8bd6401594d8a977161\",\"title\":\"bashgeek/textwerk - Fix IRC XPC service crash on macOS 26: handle NWError.wifiAware, fix sendData rename\",\"snippet\":\"bashgeek/textwerk - Fix IRC XPC service crash on macOS 26: handle NWError.wifiAware, fix sendData rename ... NWError gained a new .wifiAware case in macOS 26; the @unknown default:\\nfatalError in translateError crashed the XPC service on any wifiAware ... bug) remained in use.\\n\\nFiles (2): XPC Services/IRC Remote Connection Manager/Classes/IRC/IRCConnectionSocketNWF.swift, XPC Services/IRC Remote Connection ... Languages: Swift\\nRepository: bashgeek/textwerk (3 stars) | Date: 2026-07-05\",\"page_last_modified\":1783217664},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/bashgeek/textual/commit/989e23efcd4e641bed57b8bd6401594d8a977161\",\"title\":\"bashgeek/textual - Fix IRC XPC service crash on macOS 26: handle NWError.wifiAware, fix sendData rename\",\"snippet\":\"bashgeek/textual - Fix IRC XPC service crash on macOS 26: handle NWError.wifiAware, fix sendData rename\\n\\nNWError gained a new .wifiAware case in macOS 26; the @unknown default: fatalError in translateError crashed the XPC service on any wifiAware error, producing \\\"Connection service closed unexpectedly\\\". Also replace the connectedHost fatalError with a safe nil return. sendData(_:) was renamed to send(_:) in Swift 3; the wrong name caused a protocol conformance error preventing the Phase 4 Swift\",\"page_last_modified\":1783217664},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/ewuehler/WiFiCheck\",\"title\":\"GitHub - ciretose-code/WiFiCheck: SwiftUI WiFi Checker Application · GitHub\",\"snippet\":\"file.\\n**Requires macOS 26 or later.\",\"page_last_modified\":-1},{\"url\":\"https://www.macworld.com/article/3110860/if-your-mac-is-having-wi-fi-issues-macos-26-4-1-is-here-to-help.html\",\"title\":\"If your Mac is having Wi-Fi issues, macOS 26.4.1 is here to help\",\"snippet\":\"If your Mac is having Wi-Fi issues, macOS 26.4.1 is here to help | Macworld ... Apr 9, 2026\\nApple on Thursday released macOS 26.4.1, an update to the macOS Tahoe operating system. ... The 26.4.1 update comes after Apple released macOS 26.4 at the end of March. macOS 26.4 included new emojis, new features for Apple Music and Podcasts, as well as security fixes. ... Check out our macOS Tahoe superguide to learn more about the Mac operating system.\",\"page_last_modified\":1775718016},{\"url\":\"https://www.macrumors.com/2025/07/02/ios-26-captive-wifi-feature/\",\"title\":\"iOS 26 Adds a Useful New Wi-Fi Feature to Your iPhone\",\"snippet\":\"With this new feature, which likely extends to macOS 26 too, it will be quicker and easier to connect multiple Apple devices to these networks.\\n*Bloomberg*'s Mark Gurman was first to report that Apple was planning this feature, which was not mentioned during the WWDC 2025 keynote last month. ... *MacRumors* contributor Aaron Perris later discovered references to it within the code for the first iOS 26 ... According to an earlier post, it seems that Weinbach had installed the second iOS 26 develo\",\"page_last_modified\":1751414400},{\"url\":\"https://www.macrumors.com/2025/06/21/ios-26-adding-two-new-wi-fi-features/\",\"title\":\"iOS 26 Adding Two New Wi-Fi Features, Allows AirDrop and AirPlay Alternatives\",\"snippet\":\"across iOS 26, iPadOS 26, and macOS Tahoe.\\nNext, iOS 26 and iPadOS 26 add support for Wi-Fi Aware, which is essentially the industry-standard equivalent of the Apple Wireless Direct Link technology behind AirDrop and AirPlay.\",\"page_last_modified\":1750464000},{\"url\":\"https://www.techloy.com/apples-macos-26-4-1-update-fixes-a-frustrating-wi-fi-problem-on-new-m5-macbooks/\",\"title\":\"Apple’s macOS 26.4.1 Update Fixes a Frustrating Wi-Fi Problem on New M5 MacBooks\",\"snippet\":\"If your MacBook has had trouble connecting to secure or managed Wi-Fi networks, installing macOS 26.4.1 should resolve the problem. ... If macOS 26.4.1 appears, choose Update Now and follow the prompts.\",\"page_last_modified\":1775828864},{\"url\":\"https://parlournews.com/mac-wi-fi-issues-why-you-must-update-to-macos-tahoe-26-4-1/\",\"title\":\"Mac Wi-Fi Issues? Why You Must Update to macOS Tahoe 26.4.1\",\"snippet\":\"One of the most notable fixes in macOS 26.4.1 addresses **Wi-Fi connectivity issues** that have plagued users of M5 MacBook models.\",\"page_last_modified\":1776085248},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/0xFireWolf/AppleBCMWLANCompanion\",\"title\":\"GitHub - 0xFireWolf/AppleBCMWLANCompanion: Revive your legacy Broadcom Wi-Fi cards on macOS Sonoma, Sequoia, and Tahoe without root patches · GitHub\",\"snippet\":\"- macOS Tahoe\\n  - 26.0 (25A354)\\n  - 26.0.1 (25A362)\\n  - 26.1 (25B78)\\n- macOS Sequoia ... - macOS Sonoma\",\"page_last_modified\":-1},{\"url\":\"https://medium.com/@iamCoder/how-to-check-if-the-connected-wifi-open-or-secure-in-ios-584b35d2f8e4\",\"title\":\"Medium\",\"snippet\":\"📱 STEP 2: Swift Code (ViewController.swift)\",\"page_last_modified\":1750832768}]}","final_result":true}}}
