nerated registry representations produce libssh2 credentials\\\" started.\\n􀟈  Test case passing 1 argument format → 1 to \\\"imported and generated registry representations produce libssh2 credentials\\\" started.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"every credential resolver error has one bounded bootstrap projection\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"OSStatus bootstrap projection is stable and contains no platform status\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"NW and POSIX classes map without endpoint or underlying prose\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"not found inaccessible malformed and platform cancellation remain distinct\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"decoded buffers clear before return and signer retirement releases parsed state\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"live client rejects fixture query before the Security matcher\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"wrong class and mismatched identity fail distinctly\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"wifiAware maps to unavailable without platform values\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"errors and credential reflection are redacted\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"cancellation after a Security call clears and releases returned bytes\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"exact opaque reference and fixed service shape the only lookup\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"one fake-only scoped query performs no enumeration or fallback\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"malformed references stop before any Keychain client call\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"optional passphrase preserves absent empty and present states\\\" with 3 test cases passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"imported and generated registry representations produce libssh2 credentials\\\" with 2 test cases passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"record generation digest truncation and trailing bytes fail closed\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"passphrase and key-format outcomes stay stable\\\" with 4 test cases passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test \\\"bounded repetitions leave no secret or query-count growth\\\" passed after 0.001 seconds.\\n􁁛  Suite \\\"macOS system-domain Keychain credential resolver\\\" passed after 0.002 seconds.\\n􁁛  Test run with 18 tests in 1 suite passed after 0.002 seconds.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3280,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 820,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
