AC coverage is 3 of 5 rows driven through `MacOSSSHBootstrapErrorMapper.network` (wifiAware mapping, preserved classes/fallback path, focused checks with toolchain distinction); older-SDK compilation and independent acceptance are declared bounds. No gates in this total classification; negative redaction assertions and the narrowing-style mutant are documented anyway. No VPN, routes, tooling, commits, publications, or LOGBOOK writes (per the active directive findings live in outcome `BUG-260916-20xt79_results.md`); the 493M worktree `.build` cache is preserved for reviewer re-runs.","reason":null}}
